# Dependencies are installed per sub-project, never committed.
# The root node_modules was tracked until now (954 files); it is untracked
# from this commit on. The blobs stay in history, so a clone is still the
# same size — removing them would need a history rewrite, which is not
# worth doing to a published repo.
node_modules

dist
dist-ssr
*.local

logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
